{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211720","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211720","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121172001:1":{"text":"皆さん、お疲れ様です。すみません、鹿霊の聖丘のまわりでは、何も異変は見つかりませんでした。","source_cn":"几位辛苦了。十分抱歉，我们没在鹿灵圣丘附近发现任何异常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2084D1FF1894BA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121172002:1":{"text":"そっちは何か分かったか？","source_cn":"不知各位有什么发现？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB08490C0E7A6D191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121172003:1":{"text":"えっと……カタストロフはいなかったんですが、すごく、すごく重大な発見がありました……","source_cn":"呃……我们没找到恶魔，但是另外有一个很大很大的发现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7405E225715454D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121172004:1":{"text":"あら！それはいいことでは？","source_cn":"是吗，那是好事呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CA34E17987998C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121172005:1":{"text":"……どうしました？そんな顔をして……","source_cn":"……你们怎么了？为什么这副表情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33785EABDB356B7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121172006:1":{"text":"実は、タレンさんに関することで……","source_cn":"因为，有关塔琳小姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE842B67731CAB03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173001:":{"text":"遅くなってごめんなさい。北の方にはカタストロフの痕跡はなかった――","source_cn":"抱歉，我回来晚了。北方没发现任何恶魔的踪迹——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x143D51CCD9B1547D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173002:":{"text":"来たわね。","source_cn":"你来了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3253F97C959B6ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173003:":{"text":"誰だ！？","source_cn":"你是谁？！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C1C4748FC574A61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173004:":{"text":"ええ！？タレン様が二人！？","source_cn":"咦，有两个塔琳殿下？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F53CE31539F6190","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121172007:1":{"text":"あなたは……なるほど、カタストロフが作り出した複製体ね？","source_cn":"你是……我明白了，是恶魔力量所做出的复制体吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BB933C566F45A35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121172008:1":{"text":"誰が偽者かはまだ分からないけどね。","source_cn":"谁是复制体还未可知。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D3672E03E2D5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121172009:1":{"text":"まさか、私もカタストロフにやられていたなんて……","source_cn":"没想到，原来我也被恶魔的力量影响了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF97356502BBEDC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121172010:1":{"text":"わわわ、目が回りそうですぅ……二人ともそっくりですよ！","source_cn":"呜哇，满满眼睛都花了……两个塔琳小姐完全一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC60CF71A288C291","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121172011:1":{"text":"どっちも口調は優しく穏やかで、カタストロフのことになると一気に豹変する……全然区別がつきません！","source_cn":"交谈的时候温柔又亲切，但一旦遇到了恶魔相关的事情就雷厉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6303CE520548474D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1121172011":{"text":"どっちも口調は優しく穏やかで、カタストロフのことになると一気に豹変する……全然区別がつきません！","source_cn":"交谈的时候温柔又亲切，但一旦遇到了恶魔相关的事情就雷厉风行……已经完全分不出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6303CE520548474D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1121172012:1":{"text":"え？ええ！？い、いったいどうやって見分けるんです！？","source_cn":"咦？唉？！这、这怎么分得出来呢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7FD037D7CB546F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1121172013:1":{"text":"見た目や、喋り方まで瓜二つ……だが思考はどうだろうか？","source_cn":"同样的样貌，同样的语气……思想又如何呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47E5E0958188F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121172014:1":{"text":"カタストロフの創造物はこの世から消え去るべき。もう一人の私も同じ考えかしら？","source_cn":"恶魔的造物，应该从这个世界上消失——另一个我，你是这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC03D516369A08C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1121172015:1":{"text":"……やっぱり同じなのね。","source_cn":"……果然完全一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19E755A7D26D618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1121172016:1":{"text":"なら、残る方法は一つね……神より賜りし、全ての邪悪を焼き尽くす聖なる炎。","source_cn":"那么，我想只有一个方法了……神明所赐的，能够烧却一切邪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AF99314944101B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1121172016":{"text":"なら、残る方法は一つね……神より賜りし、全ての邪悪を焼き尽くす聖なる炎。","source_cn":"那么，我想只有一个方法了……神明所赐的，能够烧却一切邪恶的神圣火焰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AF99314944101B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1121172017:1":{"text":"本物のセレスチアルなら、聖なる炎で傷つくはずはない。悪は燃え尽き、善はとどまる。","source_cn":"神圣的火焰不会伤害真正的半神，邪恶被烧灼净化，良善依旧留存。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F37F012F0336BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1121172018:1":{"text":"カタストロフの創造物は消え去る、それだけよ。","source_cn":"恶魔的造物会消失，仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA29107F9C37E29F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1121172019:1":{"text":"でも、そうなったら、片方のタレンさんはこの世から消えてしまうんですよ！自分たちですらどっちが複製体か分からないのに……","source_cn":"但是那样的话，就会有一个塔琳小姐彻底从世界上消失了！你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46C9AC42A9B29424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1121172020:1":{"text":"タレン様、正直お二人のどちらからも、言動に邪悪な意志は感じられません。","source_cn":"两位塔琳殿下，我从你们的话语和行动中感受不到任何邪恶的意图！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7CA89F9BD0E1AA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1121172021:1":{"text":"私から見れば、どちらも本物で神聖なる存在に見えます……本当にそれしか方法はないのですか？","source_cn":"你们在我看来，都真实又神圣……真的只有这个办法吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF270AC3FE1FD37D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1121172022:1":{"text":"覚えておきなさい、カタストロフの創造物は決してこの世にとどまらせてはいけない。それが私だとしても例外ではないの。","source_cn":"请记住，恶魔的造物决不能存留于世，如果那恶魔的造物是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8E3669785208D70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1121172023:1":{"text":"もし本当に自分が偽者なら、喜んでこの身を燃やして灰となるわ。","source_cn":"如果真的身为虚假，那么我愿意被自己的火焰烧为灰烬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61A50F03080FC358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1121172024:1":{"text":"何かを守るには、覚悟が必要なの。かつて、私の前に立ちはだかってくれた人たちがいたわ。彼らの犠牲があったから、今の私がいる。","source_cn":"想要守护，就必须做出觉悟。曾经也有人立身在我身前，因为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE07A495B3BF43DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1121172025:1":{"text":"だから、今は私たちが決意する番よ。","source_cn":"现在，是我们做出决断的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B5B2697B06120BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1121172026:1":{"text":"ええ……やりましょう。","source_cn":"那么……来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE019EA4F19A2B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:51:1121175001:":{"text":"聖なる炎よ……燃え上がれ！","source_cn":"神圣的火焰——燃烧吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0985FF7BFCC384CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:51:1121175002:":{"text":"聖なる炎よ……燃え上がれ！","source_cn":"神圣的火焰——燃烧吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0985FF7BFCC384CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:54:1101021165:0":{"text":"二人のタレンは自分が消えることも恐れず、自らを証明しようとして聖なる炎に包まれた。あなたたちの前には、一人のタレンだけが残った。","source_cn":"两个塔琳愿意证明自身，即便就此消失也无所谓。她们走进神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBC1EC70FB991ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:0:1":{"text":"炎で自分を浄化するのか……？","source_cn":"你要用火焰净化自己……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x68B1B7CB7B32840F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"炎で自分を浄化するのか……？","female":"炎で自分を浄化するの……？","variant_male_record_index":"59636","variant_female_record_index":"59637","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status